d have finished you off that day. You deserved no mercy!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#VIOLET#*当商队的最后一名成员奄奄一息时，你看着他，看到他眼中充满了仇恨。*#LAST#\n我们那天真该彻底除掉你。你根本不配得到怜悯！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c66862247573d9c14f54c1c06b8c112002d7c1174a8e26810bd6371289b341d5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0ecd0cead6f32b34232731ff1da16dbf98dae92081b6be7dfc2d753982c5f8fc","logical_entry_identity":"9f251c4d8cc8acbcec21cdd7dbdb6bdbeae74fe4342e861e8c0f4eb572a22a00","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I have already sent parties to clear out the remainder of the prides as you progressed, and have instructed to keep a sharp eye out for any orbs of command you may have missed.\n\tWhich do you not have? I can check with the parties if they found any. Our sources indicate that you should have four: one of Undeath, one of Destruction, one of Dragons, and one of Elemental might.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我们已经派出部队，清理那些被你所击溃的部落的残军。我命令他们仔细搜查，确保找到可能落下的任何指令水晶球的踪影。\n\t你缺少了什么水晶球？我会去问问他们，看看他们有没有找到什么线索。我们得到情报，应该有四颗指令水晶球：亡灵水晶球，毁灭水晶球，巨龙水晶球，元素水晶球。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aebc1da2a014f67a05673289caff49985b97d844b0ecf3dd092d0eee00470940","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0edcf51ef091856e882567befa6f299ba8087cd053c33ba33463a915bda8ac19","logical_entry_identity":"25be9e9cc8069e394a983eaa4ac8ca855dbc7c95e7b6653f0012221320fa7293","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"item antimagic scouring","source_tag":"damage type","target":"物品反魔清除"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c6bec51ab6edbcf8a381ecbe4be8e6a4e250d2ecc29693e623c3166ab952cf7f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0edd07774db43acdd6ac3b661079138c3fa65093081fd0d57fe6933fe8d4c7da","logical_entry_identity":"91bbd2b4b9b519d72a5625c6e872e14e3fcf3035436a45b5011042be56c3b617","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Steeped in fungal malevolence, this mold refused to die.  How a mold becomes a skeleton, though, is beyond you.  Are those its own bones, or the bones of hapless adventurers?","source_tag":"_t","target":"这团霉菌浸透着真菌的恶意，拒绝死亡。然而，霉菌是如何变成骷髅的，你想不明白。那是它自己的骨头，还是倒霉冒险者的骨头？"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}